  "id": "crisis-intervention-service",
  "term": "crisis intervention service",
  "definition": "A crisis intervention service is a service that provides immediate support to people in crisis, such as around suicidal thoughts or plans. In this packet, it refers to a free, confidential, around-the-clock text-based support service that can also capture information about crises that may never come to medical attention.",
